  "details": "Please add a build error to the SDK if a user tries to upload an avatar with built-in SDK3 parameters in their expression parameter list.\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/animator-parameters#parameters\n\nMany SDK3 beginners add these parameters to their avatar once they visit the Animator Parameter documentation. For a beginner, \"You'll need to add these to your Playable Layer animators to use them\", does not tell the person to not add them to their synced parameter list.\n\nThe OB bug causing avatars with duplicate parameters in their synced parameter list to break is now causing many beginners avatars to break with them probably not knowing why:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1181-if-you-have-2-parameters-with-the-same-name-the-avatar-fails-to-initialize\n\nnakos",
